Today we learn about Advanced JavaScript (DOM Manipulation). Let's go!

5
00:00:20.332 --> 00:00:25.032
DOM manipulation. Say it with me. DOM manipulation!

6
00:00:28.579 --> 00:00:33.211
Query selector. Say it with me. Query selector!

7
00:00:36.671 --> 00:00:41.404
Event delegation. Say it with me. Event delegation!

8
