Local storage. Say it with me. Local storage!

9
00:00:52.653 --> 00:00:57.319
Asynchronous code. Say it with me. Asynchronous code!

10
00:01:00.768 --> 00:01:05.835
Callback function. Say it with me. Callback function!

11
00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:12.899
Promise. Say it with me. Promise!

12
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:20.683
Fetch request. Say it with me. Fetch request!

13
00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:40.730
DOM manipulation, often using a query selector, lets JavaScript change a page dynamically. Event delegation and local storage make interactive apps more efficient. Asynchronous code, using a callback function or a promise, powers a fetch request for data.

14
