Event delegation!

17
00:01:53.399 --> 00:01:58.746
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:58.796 --> 00:01:59.946
Promise!

19
00:02:00.973 --> 00:02:08.058
Did you know? Asynchronous code lets a website keep working smoothly even while waiting for slow data to load!

20
00:02:08.108 --> 00:02:10.367
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:11.654 --> 00:02:20.836
Think and answer. Why might a website need to fetch data without reloading the whole page?

22
